 "notes": [
  "Source: 《中国统计年鉴2025》 (国家统计局), https://www.stats.gov.cn/sj/ndsj/2025/left.htm. No .xls/.xlsx/.htm versions exist (404) for any of these tables; all values transcribed from the official JPG images (zoomed crops) and checked against totals.",
  "t2_12/t2_13: sample-survey counts (sampling ratio 1.028‰), copied as printed, NOT scaled to population. Figures are weighted/rounded, so 合计≠男+女 and totals≠sum of categories by ±1–2 in many cells; this is in the source, not a transcription error (spot-checked at 3x zoom, e.g. 福建/江西 研究生).",
  "t2_12 columns: each status has 小计/男/女; the 15+ population total column has no sub-label in the source and is named '合计' here.",
  "t6_7/t6_12 rows are the five income quintile groups (row labels as printed, line break removed); columns are years 2018–2024, unit 元 per capita per year, current prices.",
  "t24_5 rows: '#汽车', '摩托车', '拖拉机' are sub-items of 机动车 ('#' = 其中, of which; 摩托车/拖拉机 indented without '#'); '#自行车' is a sub-item of 非机动车. 总计 = 机动车 + 非机动车 + 行人乘车人 + 其他 (verified).",
  "t24_6 provincial sums match 全国 exactly except 直接财产损失 (sum 134905.2 vs 134905.3, rounding).",
  "t8_25: blank cells in the source (disaster type did not occur / no data) are stored as null; '0.0' cells are kept as 0.0. The five crop sub-columns do not sum to the crop total (other disaster types such as 地震/森林火灾 are not broken out). Provincial sums match 全国 within rounding (倒塌房屋 6.48 vs 6.44 printed).",
  "Province row keys use names without the internal spacing used for alignment in the images (e.g. '北  京' -> '北京'); national row key is '全国'."
 ],
 "gaps": [
  "No unreadable cells; all images were legible. t8_25 contains nulls only where the source cell is blank."
 ]
